        "S007"
      ],
      "status": "AI_GENERATED_FROM_CALCULATED_DATA",
      "confidence": "Low-Medium"
    },
    {
      "id": "OBS4",
      "title": "Data-readiness actions to move from synthetic prototype to audit-grade reporting",
      "observation": "While service delivery achieved a 98.3% on-time rate across 11,371 tracked cycles, key production data gaps remain: wearer counts are summed across product rows (28,367 assignments vs ~12,078 deduplicated minimum wearers), service-request root causes are uncategorized, and Swedish laundry L003 shows a laundry-vs-customer volume reconciliation warning.",
      "recommended_action": "Connect eLindström wearer master data, service-request category exports, and validated WWS laundry volume feeds in Phase 2.",
      "owner": "Lindström Data & IT",
      "steering_question": "Which data feeds should be prioritized first to support NorthStar's upcoming CSRD Scope 3 disclosures?",
